`scripts/pin-forearm-mechanics-reasoning.mjs --check` reproduces the exact
identities from the displayed catalogue. Runtime compares the whole pinned
source identity, including side, geometry metadata and ordered source hashes.
All choices must be eligible in the current scope, same side and loaded bundle.
The pre-existing extensor carpi radialis longus concept supplies one real
comparison for brevis without changing its definition.

These are drafts, not anatomical or clinical approvals. The meshes do not
demonstrate dynamic motion, individual tendon/nerve territories, patient-space
registration or clinical diagnosis. Review evidence is bound to this teaching
revision; no approval transfers from a prior quiz or source revision. Main
integration should run the focused test once after dispatch integration, then
perform the shared validation and release checks. No deployment or installed
preview is claimed by this candidate.
